[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2615469393","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102038#issuecomment-2615469393","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102038","id":2615469393,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b5OVR","user":{"login":"Faless","id":1687918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2ODc5MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1687918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless","html_url":"https://github.com/Faless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-27T11:12:39Z","updated_at":"2025-01-27T11:12:39Z","body":"As stated in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100631 :\r\n\r\nThe wslay library, somehow unintuitively, will call the frame recv end\r\ncallback for control frames.\r\n\r\nThis has the side effect that while receiving a long message (i.e. a\r\nmulti-frame message), if a control frame (e.g. a ping or pong) is received\r\nit may seem that a FIN frame has been received, resulting in the current\r\ncode truncating the message.\r\n\r\nThe library do not provide a way  to check the opcode in the callback (you\r\nare reading the opcode from the value we store, which is always going to be\r\neither a binary or text frame because we only store those).\r\n\r\nSo this is the same as doing no check at all, like we did before #100631 .\r\n\r\nI'm currently traveling, I'll try the MRP as soon as I can to see why\r\n#100631 doesn't appear to be working for you.\r\n\r\nOn Sat, Jan 25, 2025, 21:38 Lily ***@***.***> wrote:\r\n\r\n> @gofastlily <https://github.com/gofastlily> requested review from\r\n> @godotengine/network on: #102038\r\n> <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102038> Reimplement\r\n> _wsl_frame_recv_end_callback() as a code owner.\r\n>\r\n> —\r\n> Reply to this email directly, view it on GitHub\r\n> <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102038#event-16068207083>, or\r\n> unsubscribe\r\n> <https://github.com/notifications/unsubscribe-auth/AAM4C3W6ZHVV5K54HMKPO2L2MPY6DAVCNFSM6AAAAABV3V2OOSVHI2DSMVQWIX3LMV45UABCJFZXG5LFIV3GK3TUJZXXI2LGNFRWC5DJN5XDWMJWGA3DQMRQG4YDQMY>\r\n> .\r\n> You are receiving this because your review was requested.Message ID:\r\n> ***@***.***>\r\n>\r\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2615469393/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2615999339","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102038#issuecomment-2615999339","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102038","id":2615999339,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b7Ptr","user":{"login":"gofastlily","id":120291200,"node_id":"U_kgDOByt_gA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120291200?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gofastlily","html_url":"https://github.com/gofastlily","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gofastlily/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gofastlily/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gofastlily/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gofastlil